  "description": "Reid Bikes MTB Pro WSD | 27.5\" women's mountain bike\nDesigned for comfortable trail riding and everyday adventures – the Reid Bikes MTB Pro WSD combines women-specific geometry, reliable components and versatile off-road performance.\nThe Reid Bikes MTB Pro WSD is designed for riders looking for a comfortable, capable mountain bike for exploring trails, tackling uneven terrain and enjoying everyday cycling. Featuring a custom women's-specific Alloy 6061 frame with internal cable routing and 27.5\" wheels, it offers responsive handling and a considered riding position for a range of riding conditions.\nAn 80mm suspension fork with lockout helps absorb bumps and uneven surfaces, providing added comfort and control when riding off-road. Its women-specific geometry and carefully selected components are designed to support a comfortable riding position, while 680mm alloy riser handlebars and Reid MTB grips offer confident steering and control.\nThe 2.35\" all-terrain MTB tyres provide reliable grip and stability across trails, gravel paths and mixed surfaces. A Shimano 3x7-speed drivetrain with a 42/34/24T chainset and 14–28T freewheel provides a range of gearing options for everyday rides and moderate climbs. Mechanical disc brakes with 160mm rotors deliver controlled stopping power, while double-wall alloy rims and a sealed bottom bracket add durability for regular riding.\nWhether you're exploring local trails, navigating uneven urban roads or enjoying weekend rides with family, the Reid Bikes MTB Pro WSD offers a versatile combination of comfort, control and dependable mountain bike performance.\nThe Reid Bikes MTB Pro WSD is ideal for:\n\nWomen looking for a mountain bike, with a custom women's-specific Alloy 6061 frame and considered component choices\n\nTrail riding and off-road adventures, with 80mm front suspension and lockout to help manage bumps and uneven terrain\n\nComfortable everyday cycling, with women-specific geometry designed to support a comfortable riding position\n\nRiding across mixed surfaces, with 27.5\" wheels and 2.35\" all-terrain MTB tyres for grip and stability\n\nTackling varied terrain, with a Shimano 3x7-speed drivetrain offering a choice of gearing options\n\nControlled braking, with mechanical disc brakes and 160mm rotors\n\nWeekend adventures and family rides, with a versatile setup suited to trails, paths and everyday journeys",
